abstract: >-
  A speculative hypothesis treating the universe as a globally conserved
  informational structure, where cosmological cycles correspond to changes in
  local information readability rather than temporal restarts. Version 0.1.8
  adds a finite reference-resource example: under a fixed charge-symmetric
  processing class and loss of access to the old input, unread priming strictly
  shrinks the attainable measurement set. Both sets span the same qubit algebra;
  full symmetric access to the retained old input restores equivalence.
  Selected operator lemmas and an exact scalar separation are Lean-checked,
  not the concrete channel and discrimination derivations or physical inputs.
  Earlier results and core postulates are unchanged. No physical algebra
  selector, cosmological entropy functional, transition dynamics, or prediction
  is derived. Reviews and diagnostic checks are internal and AI-assisted.
